activity Fund Transfer Initiate
activity Transfer Requisition Validate
activity Transfer Authorize
activity Transfer Execute
activity Transfer Document Generate
activity Transfer Document Assess
activity Stakeholders Notify
activity Accounts Reconcile
activity Transfer Process Close
bind Fund Transfer Initiate: Identifier Transfer, Amount Transfer, Category Account
bind Transfer Requisition Validate: Identifier Transfer, State Transfer, Identifier Validator
bind Transfer Authorize: Identifier Transfer, Identifier Approver
bind Transfer Execute: Identifier Transfer
bind Transfer Document Generate: Identifier Transfer
bind Transfer Document Assess: Identifier Transfer, Degree Discrepancy, Identifier Reviewer
bind Stakeholders Notify: Identifier Transfer, Method Notification
bind Accounts Reconcile: Identifier Transfer
bind Transfer Process Close: Identifier Transfer
Identifier Transfer: integer between 1 and 999999
Amount Transfer: float between 0.01 and 1000000.0
State Transfer: Pending, Validated, Approved, Completed, Rejected
Category Account: Checking, Savings, Business
Identifier Validator: integer between 1 and 9999
Identifier Approver: integer between 1 and 9999
Method Notification: Email, SMS, Push Notification
Degree Discrepancy: Low, Medium, High
Identifier Reviewer: integer between 1 and 9999
Init[Fund Transfer Initiate] | |
Chain Succession[Fund Transfer Initiate, Transfer Requisition Validate] | | |
Chain Succession[Transfer Requisition Validate, Transfer Authorize] | | |
Chain Succession[Transfer Authorize, Transfer Execute] | | |0,2,h
Chain Succession[Transfer Execute, Transfer Document Generate] | | |
Chain Succession[Transfer Document Generate, Transfer Document Assess] | | |
Chain Succession[Transfer Document Assess, Stakeholders Notify] | | |0,1,h
Chain Succession[Stakeholders Notify, Accounts Reconcile] | | |
Chain Succession[Accounts Reconcile, Transfer Process Close] | | |
End[Transfer Process Close] | |